<section class="section prose"><a class="back" href="/">← Reader</a><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p><h1>A quieter corner of the internet.</h1>
<p>The internet has made information abundant. Attention, however, is still limited.</p>
<p>Reader exists to offer a smaller, calmer selection of things worth thinking about.</p>
<h2>Our editorial principles</h2><ul><li>No clickbait.</li><li>No manufactured outrage.</li><li>No fake certainty.</li><li>No empty motivational promises.</li><li>Respect the reader's intelligence.</li><li>Every article should leave the reader with something worth keeping.</li></ul>
